= content_for :body_class, 'portfolio-template'

/!  Begin Page Content 
section.hero.d-flex
  .container-lg
	.squiggle.mb-5
	.row.justify-content-start.align-items-center
	  .col-md-6.col-lg-6
		h1 Capitalize Website Redesign
		p.lead
			| Capitalize is a financial software company focused on helping users manage and optimize their retirement accounts.
		.d-inline.mb-5.mb-md-0
			= link_to 'View Website <i class="fad fa-external-link-alt"></i>'.html_safe, 'http://hicapitalize.com/', target: "_blank"
	  .col-md-6.col-lg-6
		.row.mb-3
			.col-md-6
				h6 Client
				p Capitalize
			.col-md-6
				h6 Year
				p 2021-2023
		.row.mb-3
			.col-md-6
				h6 Services
				p Web Design, WordPress Development, Front-End Development, A/B Testing
			.col-md-6
				h6 Technologies
				p Wordpress, HTML, PHP, Tailwind CSS/SCSS, JS, ACF, Figma

/! Project Summary
section.project-at-a-glance
	.container
		.row
			.col-lg-12
				.squiggle
				h6.text-center.mb-3 Project at a glance
				h2.text-center Bringing a new brand to life.
				p.lead.text-center.mb-5
		  			| Supported Capitalize’s rebrand by translating its new visual direction into a flexible WordPress experience built to support evolving products, marketing initiatives, and experimentation.
		.row.highlights
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-swatchbook
				h5 Brand evolution
				p Translated Capitalize’s refreshed visual identity into a cohesive, responsive website experience.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-people-group
				h5 Cross-functional collaboration
				p Partnered closely with the Lead Software Engineer and internal teams to bring new website experiences from concept through implementation.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-grid-2
				h5 Flexible content system
				p Built reusable WordPress components and templates that supported new pages, posts, and ongoing marketing needs.
			.col-md-3.mb-5
				i.fad.fa-gears
				h5 End-to-end execution
				p Developed A/B testing experiences and supported ongoing website updates, debugging, performance, and SEO.
		.row
			.text-center
				= link_to "#challenge", class: "anchor-link" do
					| explore full project
					i.fad.fa-arrow-down.ms-2

/! Challenge
section#challenge.challenge
  .container
	.row.align-items-center.g-5
	  .col-lg-5
		h2 The challenge

		p.lead.text-mb-5
		  | Capitalize was evolving its brand and product experience, but the existing website no longer reflected its new visual direction or provided the flexibility needed to support changing marketing and product needs.

		p.lead
		  | The challenge was translating the refreshed brand into a scalable WordPress experience while maintaining consistency across new pages, content, and experiments. The site needed to give the team greater flexibility to evolve quickly without sacrificing usability, performance, or brand cohesion.

	  .col-lg-7
	  	= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-before-after.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize Website Before & After" do
			= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-before-after.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Capitalize Website Before & After"
		p.small.text-center.mt-3.mb-0
		  | Before and after: The website evolved alongside Capitalize’s rebrand, introducing a more distinctive visual system and flexible foundation for new content and experiences.

/! Approach
section#approach
  .container
	.row.g-5
		.col-lg-5.position-sticky.mx-auto.top-0.vh-100
			h2 My approach
			p.lead.mb-4
				| I worked closely with Capitalize’s Lead Software Engineer to translate the evolving brand and product needs into a flexible WordPress experience, focusing on reusable development, responsive implementation, and continuous iteration.
			.approach-steps
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-people-group
						h5 Align & plan
					p Collaborated with the Lead Software Engineer and internal teams to understand design requirements, technical considerations, and priorities for new website experiences.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-pen-ruler
						h5 Design & develop
					p Translated provided designs and brand direction into responsive WordPress experiences using ACF, Tailwind, PHP, JavaScript, and reusable components.
				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-laptop-code
						h5 Build for flexibility
					p Strategically built reusable templates and components around how content would be managed and expanded over time. For the Learning Center, I structured templates to support different resource types while maintaining a consistent experience.

				.approach-step
					.approach-title
						i.fad.fa-flask
						h5 Test & optimize
					p Supported A/B testing, ongoing website updates, debugging, performance improvements, and SEO as the website and business continued to evolve.

		.col-lg-7
			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4.mb-5
				h6.mb-2 Rebrand implementation
				h3 Translating the new visual direction
				p.mb-4 Worked from Capitalize’s evolving design system to translate typography, color, iconography, interactive components, navigation, and data visualizations into reusable, responsive website experiences.
				.row.g-4
					.col-md-6
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-design-system.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize Design System" do
								= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-design-system.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Capitalize Design System"
						h5.mt-3.mb-2 Design system
					.col-md-6
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-blog-templates.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Design variations created for Capitalize’s editorial content and translated into reusable WordPress templates to support different article layouts and content needs. " do
								= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-blog-templates.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Capitalize blog template design variations developed into reusable WordPress templates"
						h5.mt-3.mb-2 Blog template system

			.card.bg-gradient-soft.p-4
				h6.mb-2 Experimentation
				h3 Testing and iterating
				p.mb-4 Built A/B test variations to help evaluate different homepage experiences and refine the customer journey, translating design concepts into responsive WordPress experiences aligned with Capitalize’s design system.
				.row.g-4
					.col
						= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-ab-test.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Two Capitalize homepage variations created for A/B testing" do
							= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-ab-test.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto border border-2 border-dark rounded-3 box-shadow", :alt=>"Two Capitalize homepage variations created for A/B testing"

/! Outcome				
section.portfolio-info#outcome
	.container-fluid
		.row.justify-content-between.g-0.mx-md-0
			.col-12.col-md-5.position-sticky.d-flex.align-items-center.vh-100.mx-auto.top-0.px-lg-5
				.flex-grow-1
					h2 The outcome
					p.lead.mb-4 The updated website brought Capitalize’s refreshed brand to life through a more cohesive and responsive digital experience. Reusable WordPress components gave the team greater flexibility to launch new content and experiences, while ongoing testing and optimization supported the website as product and marketing priorities evolved
					div
						.d-flex.gap-2
							i.fad.fa-layer-group 
							h5 Stronger brand consistency
						p Translated the refreshed visual direction into a cohesive experience across new pages and content.
					div
						.d-flex.gap-2
							i.fad.fa-diagram-project
							h5 More flexible development
						p Created reusable components and templates that made it easier to expand the website while maintaining consistency.
					div
						.d-flex.gap-2
							i.fad.fa-eye
							h5 Continuous optimization
						p Supported A/B testing, SEO, performance improvements, debugging, and ongoing development as the website evolved.
					p.mt-4 The result was a more scalable digital foundation that could evolve alongside Capitalize’s brand, products, and marketing needs.
			.col-12.col-md-7
				div.pt-md-10
					= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-showcase.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize Homepage" do
						= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-showcase.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto", :alt=>"Capitalize Homepage"
					= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-about-page.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize About Page" do
						= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-about-page.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto", :alt=>"Capitalize Homepage"
					= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-resources.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize About Page" do
						= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-resources.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto", :alt=>"Capitalize Resources"
					= link_to image_path("portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-reviews.jpg"), "data-fancybox"=>"gallery", "data-caption"=>"Capitalize Reviews" do
						= image_tag "portfolio/capitalize/capitalize-reviews.jpg", :class=>"img-fluid w-100 h-auto", :alt=>"Capitalize Reviews"

/! What I Learned					
section
	.container
		.row
			.col-lg-12
				h2 What I learned
				p.lead.mb-3 Working at Capitalize gave me more experience collaborating closely with engineering and translating an evolving design system into production-ready website experiences. I learned a lot from working with the Lead Software Engineer, especially around building reusable components and finding solutions that balanced the intended design with technical requirements.
				p.lead.mb-3 I also gained a deeper understanding of the fintech industry and how A/B testing, SEO, and ongoing optimization can help a marketing website evolve alongside changing brand and marketing needs.
				.d-inline.mb-5.mb-md-0
					= link_to 'View Website <i class="fad fa-external-link-alt"></i>'.html_safe, 'http://hicapitalize.com/', target: "_blank"
				//.squiggle.justify-content-start.align-items-start
				.squiggle-vertical	

/!  Browse More Projects
= render :partial => "shared/portfolio_browsemore"
/!  Portfolio CTA
= render :partial => "shared/portfolio_cta"